{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act9mini_level_act9mini_st05",
  "groupId": "act9mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "骑士之道",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9mini/level_act9mini_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8cb511cdcc184575358f55386b6f8ea7625b32999b02b607a04b7d840ffb6900",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔1.5-5"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "决斗中不要随意和对手交流。我没教过你吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "那么，为什么您不用法术？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "我倒是想先问问你，看你法术又有长进，那想必你已经意识到那个真相了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......关于这件事，是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "但是！玛恩纳叔叔，我并不希望您在这种时候——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "无需多言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "我的剑被你打落，那就是你赢了，玛嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......即使......您从头到尾都没有使用法术吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "胜负就只是胜负，一切外因都是借口，我什么时候把你教育得这么优柔寡断了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "既然你已经意识到当年你的祖父为你的天真付出了什么，你就更应该明白你回到这里的意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "玛嘉烈，你在践踏父亲的意志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "难道祖父的意志，就是教我们做一个懦夫吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "“不畏苦暗”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "是啊，不畏苦暗......你赢下了决斗，你赢得了一个执迷不悟的机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "记得祈祷你的一意孤行，不会把太多的人卷进来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......叔叔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "您还是觉得，我们已经回不到那个时代了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "玛嘉烈，你居然还能问出这样的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "稍后我有一场电话会议。特锦赛让人们都很繁忙，至于你的夺冠游戏......最好不要让我分心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "正视现实吧，正视他人的生活。看看别人的柴米油盐，别再因为你自己的荣耀就对他人抱有幻想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "你会失望的。迟早会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "如果我没有和您一样呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......一样？你吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "那看来流放的日子里，你还是被你的那些萨卡兹朋友照顾得太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐，你没事吧......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯......我没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "好啦玛莉娅，别抱这么紧。这家伙的手臂应该已经麻了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "啊！抱、抱歉......真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "唉。不过我是真的没想到，竟然会在今天看见你们两个大打出手——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "——玛恩纳的剑，很沉吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔他这些年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "普普通通，就过着普普通通的日子。早出晚归的工作，永远在忙着应付会议和客户的刁难，偶尔因为“临光”之名而受到争议。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "不过这样的“普普通通”，对他而言，恐怕和受刑也没什么差别吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "毕竟他以前是那么的......唉，算了！不提啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "看看你眉头皱的，赢了也没什么好心情，是吧？你们一家子都是这样，总是一根筋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......但至少玛恩纳叔叔也同意姐姐参赛了，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "只要姐姐能再一次赢得冠军，玛恩纳叔叔肯定也不会说什么的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "毕竟这也是为了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "为了家族。为了自己。为了，骑士的荣耀。\n其实我明白，我明白在如今的骑士之国所得到的，大都与荣耀相去甚远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "玛莉娅？怎么突然不说话了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "肚子饿了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姑、姑母！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "不过现在，先让玛嘉烈休息一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......喂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "很抱歉，我刚回到家，在处理一些私事......没关系，文件已经批注好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "特锦赛的广告支持......？我吗？不，您别拿我开玩笑了，我不擅长做这些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......嗯。当然，这是工作，不该讨价还价，抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "好的，我马上就到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......窗户开着，托兰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "你身手退步了，我能感觉你的气息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "但是下一次，麻烦你从正门进来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......好，没受什么伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔手下留情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "嗯......毕竟他连丁点法术都没用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "其实，我也很久没见过玛恩纳那副表情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "——好啦！起来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "接下来呢？你得去骑士协会那里报到吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "会有一些繁琐的流程，不过，现在还没到那个时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐......我们先前就那么闯入了那场不了了之的比赛……真的没问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "问题？这个人之前可还是个被流放的感染者哦？她可是直接砸烂了竞技场的外墙冲进场内的哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "事到如今，干扰一两场比赛已经根本无所谓了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "好、好像也是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "麻烦不会少的。当年也好，现在也罢，只要卡西米尔还是这副模样，我们就会遭到各种阻挠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐还是打算参加特锦赛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "这是......姐姐一定要做的事情吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......玛莉娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "不......只是，姐姐总算回家了，协会应该也不会为难叔叔和临光家族......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "可如果姐姐再像几年前一样被联合会盯上的话，我们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......玛莉娅说得不无道理，玛嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你还是那个耀骑士。无论骑士协会怎么处理，无论监正会怎么决定，你终究都是民众和骑士们眼中的耀骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "我......我也不明白，玛嘉烈，我不明白你坚持再一次参加特锦赛，到底在想些什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你一定有自己的打算吧，虽然你们一家子的犟脾气一模一样，但也不代表你真的那么有勇无谋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......这只是一个开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "即使在特锦赛上再一次获得胜利......或是落败，都只是一个开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "玛莉娅，佐菲娅姑母，如果所有人都怯懦地躲藏在一边，对这个社会冷眼旁观，用“无可奈何”来安慰自己——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "——那我们何时才能真正取回荣耀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "难道卡西米尔的骑士，一辈子，都只能在对过去时代的哀叹中自欺欺人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......所以你想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "照亮大地的苦难，并不只是意味着我们要永无止境地去驱散黑暗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "有时候......有时候，只是为了照亮前路，只是为了给迷途中的他人，开辟新的视野。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "哪怕是如今的卡西米尔，坚持信仰，依旧是有意义的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......好吧，看来你倒是决心坚定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "不过，你才刚回卡西米尔就闹出这么一场好戏，有机会的话......玛嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "别忘了，你回家了。这里有你的家人，有你的回忆，有玛莉娅......还有我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "至少，给玛莉娅一个撒娇的时间吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姑、姑母！你说什么呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "这个孩子，这段时间，已经够努力了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "也、也没有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯。我知道，我以你为豪，玛莉娅。你真的......真的长大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "玛莉娅·临光，你会是一个优秀的骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "啊......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "关于这件事......姐姐。你想参加特锦赛的话，现在才开始积累积分，应该来不及吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "时间紧迫，但并不是毫无可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "是的......例如那位近几年崭露头角的烛骑士，传闻她积累积分，只花了一个月不到的时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "话虽如此，烛骑士是在预赛早期完成了积分储备，就算玛嘉烈能立刻得到骑士协会的认可，我们的时间也不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你有什么打算吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......赛制有一些改变，但不离其宗。只要能在混战赛里得到一次优胜，还是有机会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "但是，这很冒险吧！？连我都会被骑士们特意针对，姐姐亲自上阵的话，只会引来更厉害的对手......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "对。而且还不排除那些企业家们给你下绊子的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "总之，这件事得尽快规划......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": ".......我、我有一个办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "玛莉娅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "独立骑士......我也好，姐姐也好，在没有加入骑士团的情况下，是以“骑士家族”为单位参赛的，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......是这样......比赛和注册时的标志，都是用的临光家族的纹章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "而且，我记得，不光是“同一个骑士团”，“同一个骑士家族”之间的骑士，也是可以让渡积分的，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "——玛莉娅！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "不。我不能接受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "玛莉娅，这是你身为骑士奋战的证明，我不能——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "——我不在乎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "我......一开始选择成为骑士，只是不希望我们的家，不再是那个家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "临光家族的祖辈......爷爷，爸爸，还有姐姐。我不想失去这些东西，我想保护临光家的荣耀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "但是......但是我意识到了，我还是把事情想得，太肤浅了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "如果我们按照他们的意思，去参赛，为了维护骑士之名而成为他们的骑士......那也......没有真的改变什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......其实，我并不想成为骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "骑士改变不了骑士，姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "玛莉娅......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "如果有些事情，只有姐姐才能做到，就请你去做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "我......只是想......让这个家还是我们的家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "我明白了，玛莉娅。但是，我还需要考虑一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......好啦，不要这么沉重，办法还有很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "一会要去老马丁那儿喝一杯吗？玛嘉烈难得回来，那几个老家伙肯定也想和她多聊聊吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔那边......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......你们两个就别去刺激他了。我会去看看情况的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "不过，玛嘉烈，还有一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "这座城市的感染者比以往都要多，而无胄盟也比任何时候都活跃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "小心些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "报到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "情况如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "......耀骑士与玛恩纳·临光于刚才进行了一场决斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "从唇语判断，应该是不欢而散。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "唉，真希望她就这么老老实实待在家里，和许久未见的家人团团圆圆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "千万不要去掺和什么奇怪的事情啊，耀骑士阁下，不然我们可就要劳心费神了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "......呃。白金阁下，所以我们.....？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "继续监视。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "如果耀骑士有什么动作......先通知我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......其他人在进行什么任务？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "text": "呃......根据规定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "我不能知道，是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "算了，反正不是和感染者有关，就是和监正会有关吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "随便吧，别轮到我们出场就好啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......玛恩纳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "玛恩纳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......有什么事吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你......还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "最后那轮交锋，玛嘉烈虽然收手了，但你毕竟没有穿盔甲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "不劳费心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "......出乎你的意料了，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "其实也出乎所有人的意料，她......变得比想象中要更......强大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......你只是来说这些的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "我是在关心你，玛恩纳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "我沦落到要你来关心了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "是啊，你不会还没有意识到吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......只是扭伤而已。她的剑法确实成长惊人，但是还没到化解不了的地步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "不过......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "你想说，为什么玛嘉烈变成了这样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "当然，还有她的萨卡兹同伴，那些人......都是高尚的人，高尚到让人敬畏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "这些年，她经历的一切也许超过了你我的想象，玛恩纳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "稍微......放下身段和她们聊一聊，不好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......你开始学会指手画脚了，佐菲娅。教玛莉娅成为骑士，就让你这么有成就感吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "在玛嘉烈变得光彩夺目之前，你和她们的父亲，你们兄弟二人曾是我们所有人心目中的英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "我知道你对我们的态度，马丁也明白，老弗和科瓦尔都明白。但是，我对你也同样......失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "text": "就这样吧，祝你工作愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "......这里，有人生活的痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "text": "是啊，他们的生活还残留在这里......可是，他们躲藏起来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "这已经是......我们见到的第三个聚落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "在奢华的城市之中，感染者总是会逃进这些狭隘阴冷的角落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "很难想象，卡西米尔会对此无动于衷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "text": "阿米娅和那位和蔼的骑士婆婆，说的就是这些感染者吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "......是啊。连骑士们都知情。那么事情一定不会这么简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "还有力气吗，夜莺？也不早了，我们可以回去休息一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "text": "不，我还能再坚持一会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "那我们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "text": "呀——什么动静？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "施工队......他们在拆除楼房......以及地下构造区的部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "text": "......可如果有感染者还躲藏在地下的话......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "把今天见到的一切都记下吧，丽兹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "也许临光她会了解些什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "耀骑士无言地行走在长廊上。\n荣耀像是路边的篱笆，冠军的挂像一路延绵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......玛莉娅......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......您、您是......耀骑士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "抱歉，这里还没有开放吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "啊，不......准确来说确实没有对外开放，不过您算不算外人，我可说不准......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "好，麻烦您了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "呃......抱歉，我还没做自我介绍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "请叫我马克维茨吧，发言——是负责冠军墙维护工作的员工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "我能否冒昧地问一句，耀骑士阁下，您现在是什么打算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "耀骑士。其实直到今天，我才真正重获这个封号。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "原来骑士协会已经认可......恭喜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "马克维茨回过神来，他们向前望去，面前的正是耀骑士本人的挂像。\n尽管本尊就在身边——正因为本尊就在身边，马克维茨突然产生了一种奇妙的预感。\n某些顽固的部分终于松动。某些一成不变的事情将在未来被打破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......您似乎比画像里更勇武几分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "毕竟过去很多年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "我知道您......您和骑士协会，和很多人都有矛盾。也许这不该我这样的人插嘴，不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "我还是想对您说一句话。不是作为现在的我，呃，我是指，作为一名普通的骑士爱好者，一位大骑士领居民......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "请说，其实您大可不必这么拘谨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......欢迎回到卡西米尔，耀骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "我相信，这一切，才刚刚开始，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "啊，姐姐，你去哪儿了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......稍微在大骑士领逛了逛。叔叔呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "我回来的时候，叔叔正好被叫去开会了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐刚回来，确实应该去四处看看，感觉怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "似乎没什么变化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "是吗？我可觉得这两年的商城啊，快餐店啊多了挺多来着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "但是这里......好像冷清了很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "这些年卖掉了不少家具......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "叔叔有在企业工作，我也在科瓦尔师傅的工坊帮忙。其实，日常开销完全没有问题，叔叔也不让我知道很多事情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "但是老马丁告诉过我，现在的临光家，是很多骑士贵族和商人们的眼中钉，也许叔叔的压力比我们想象的还要大吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "所以，姐姐......我们能和叔叔和好如初吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "很难，玛莉娅，但我相信会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "在我离开卡西米尔之前，其实和叔叔有过几次争吵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "那时佐菲娅姑母开导我，说是叔叔从我们父母失踪的那天开始，变得对很多事情自暴自弃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "可现在......我不能完全赞同姑母的看法，我......见过了很多人和事，事到如今，我再去面对玛恩纳叔叔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "还记得小时候爷爷和我们讲的故事吗？关于那个，叔叔第一次陪他远游，就收拾了的一个滥加赋税，让地方民不聊生的小贵族？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "记得。以前我们也没法把那样的青年和叔叔联系起来呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......未必是一些宏伟的事物才会改变人的意志，玛莉娅。我见过许多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "叔叔他......也许从那时起，就开始失望了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "玛莉娅，成为骑士，有什么感想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......其实，和我想象的不太一样。姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......嗯，我能理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "所以我还是会参赛。哪怕，没有人会理解这个决定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......姐姐......不，姐姐其实，是有支持者的吧？坚定的支持者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "闪灵姐姐和夜莺姐姐呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "虽然只是一面之缘，但是看到各位站立在万众瞩目的赛场上时的样子，我能感受到那毫不犹豫地将后背托付给对方的信任感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "姐姐，其实我早就想问了，这些年，你经历了什么呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......我迟早会说给你听的，玛莉娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "不过，这是一段很长很长的故事，也不会像以前给你念的骑士小说那样，总能有一个团圆的结局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "我们是姐妹嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹劫匪",
      "text": "抢啊！杀啊！把这些食物全部掠走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "骑士？卡西米尔的骑士为什么会在这里！？人都死光了，你们还装模作样要妨碍我们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "......耀骑士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "text": "骑士意味着......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不！临光小姐！现在去冲进风暴太危险了，得让其他干员——不，我和你一起去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "——浮士德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "把她那张嘴给我打穿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "守林人",
      "text": "......骑士从没帮过我们游击队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "守林人",
      "text": "我的队长和副队长等了那么多年，但等到最后，援军也没有来。只有我们自己战斗到最后一刻，战斗到被乌萨斯吞噬，只有几个人活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "解说",
      "text": "重回赛场的耀骑士！究竟打算给我们展现怎样的风采！！难道本届特锦赛，将创造一个数十年难遇的传奇吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "解说",
      "text": "感染者还是骑士！？胜利还是败北！？承载了多少梦想的刀刃，究竟是否还保有锋芒！让我们拭目以待！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "解说",
      "text": "有请——耀骑士——玛嘉烈·临光——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "长路至此，骑士回到了故乡。\n一如既往的，耀骑士向前迈步。\n迎接她最大的挑战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
